<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>topofuzz report — {{ run_id }}</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    background: #fafafa;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2rem 0 .5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: .2rem; }
  .banners { margin: .75rem 0 1rem 0; }
  .banner {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: .15rem .55rem;
    margin-right: .5rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: .85rem;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .banner-dev-key { background: #fff3b0; color: #6b5b00; border: 1px solid #d9c45a; }
  .banner-jury    { background: #d6e4ff; color: #1e3a8a; border: 1px solid #6f8fce; }
  .banner-degraded { background: #ffd6d6; color: #7a1f1f; border: 1px solid #c95757; }
  .wc-stable {
    background: #e0f5e0;
    border-left: 4px solid #3da06e;
    padding: .5rem .75rem;
    margin: .75rem 0;
    color: #1f5f3a;
    font-size: .9rem;
  }
  .wc-card {
    border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .wc-head {
    background: #f0f3f8;
    padding: .4rem .65rem;
    font-size: .9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcfcf;
  }
  .wc-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #fff;
    padding: .05rem .4rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: .75rem;
    margin-right: .4rem;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .wc-eval { font-weight: bold; }
  .wc-flip { color: #555; margin-left: .6rem; font-size: .8rem; }
  .wc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .wc-side {
    padding: .55rem .65rem;
    border-right: 1px dashed #d8d8d8;
    font-size: .82rem;
    word-break: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .wc-side:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .wc-side-head {
    margin-bottom: .35rem;
    padding-bottom: .25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    color: #333;
  }
  .wc-verdict-pass { color: #1f5f3a; font-weight: bold; }
  .wc-verdict-fail { color: #7a1f1f; font-weight: bold; }
  .wc-trace p { margin: .2rem 0; }
  .wc-trace .nid { color: #1e3a8a; font-weight: bold; }
  .wc-trace .role { color: #777; font-size: .76rem; }
  .wc-rationale {
    margin-top: .35rem;
    padding-top: .25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    color: #555;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .warning {
    background: #fff0d6;
    border-left: 4px solid #d99700;
    padding: .5rem .75rem;
    margin: .75rem 0;
    color: #6b4400;
    font-size: .85rem;
  }
  table.meta { border-collapse: collapse; margin: .5rem 0; }
  table.meta td { padding: .15rem .75rem .15rem 0; vertical-align: top; }
  table.meta td.k { color: #555; }
  figure { margin: 1rem 0; text-align: center; }
  figcaption { color: #555; font-size: .85rem; margin-top: .3rem; }
  svg { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
  ul.evals { columns: 3; font-size: .85rem; color: #555; }
  footer { margin-top: 2rem; color: #777; font-size: .8rem; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: .5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>topofuzz run — {{ run_id }}</h1>
<div class="banners">
  {% if show_dev_key %}<span class="banner banner-dev-key">[DEV-KEY]</span>{% endif %}
  {% if show_jury %}<span class="banner banner-jury">[JURY]</span>{% endif %}
  {% if show_degraded %}<span class="banner banner-degraded">[DEGRADED]</span>{% endif %}
</div>

{% if matrix_warning %}<div class="warning">⚠ {{ matrix_warning }}</div>{% endif %}

<table class="meta">
  <tr><td class="k">topology</td><td>{{ topology_name }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">status</td><td>{{ status }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">judge model</td><td>{{ judge_model }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">rubric hash</td><td>{{ rubric_hash or '(none)' }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">variants</td><td>{{ n_variants }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">eval rows</td><td>{{ n_eval_rows }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">kickoff</td><td>{{ kickoff_iso }}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Per-agent influence (§6a)</h2>
<figure>
  {{ influence_svg | safe }}
  <figcaption>P(answer flips | agent moved between two variants) − P(answer flips | agent in same slot). Negative = stabilising. 95% CI via percentile bootstrap (n=1000) over evals.</figcaption>
</figure>
{% if influence_rows %}
<table class="meta">
  <tr><td class="k">agent</td><td class="k">influence</td><td class="k">95% CI</td><td class="k">note</td></tr>
{% for r in influence_rows %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ r.node_id }}</td>
    <td>{% if r.influence is none %}—{% else %}{{ '%.3f' % r.influence }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if r.ci_lower is none or r.ci_upper is none %}—{% else %}[{{ '%.3f' % r.ci_lower }}, {{ '%.3f' % r.ci_upper }}]{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if r.degenerate_reason %}{{ r.degenerate_reason }}{% endif %}</td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

<!-- WORSTCASE-SECTION-BEGIN -->
<h2>Worst-case viewer (§10a)</h2>
{% if worstcase.disabled %}
<div class="wc-stable">
  {% if worstcase.disabled_reason == 'no instability detected' %}
  No instability detected — your topology produced consistent answers across all orderings.
  {% elif worstcase.disabled_reason == 'matrix empty' or worstcase.disabled_reason == 'no continuous-judge cells' %}
  Worst-case section unavailable — no continuous-judge cells to rank.
  {% elif worstcase.disabled_reason == 'no valid differing-verdict pair' %}
  Worst-case section unavailable — no valid differing-verdict pair (data may be partial).
  {% else %}
  Worst-case section unavailable
  {% if worstcase.disabled_reason %}<span style="color:#777;font-size:.78rem;">({{ worstcase.disabled_reason }})</span>{% endif %}
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p style="color:#555;font-size:.85rem;margin:.25rem 0 .75rem 0;">
  Top {{ worstcase.cases | length }} eval rows with the most cross-ordering verdict disagreements.
  Each card shows the two variants that produced the largest score gap on a flipping pair.
</p>
{% for case in worstcase.cases %}
<div class="wc-card">
  <div class="wc-head">
    <span class="wc-tag">WORST #{{ loop.index }}</span>
    <span class="wc-eval">eval_id = {{ case.eval_id }}</span>
    <span class="wc-flip">{{ case.flip_count }} of {{ case.n_pairs }} variant pairs disagree</span>
  </div>
  <div class="wc-grid">
    {% for side in [case.variant_a, case.variant_b] %}
    <div class="wc-side">
      <div class="wc-side-head">
        <strong>Variant {{ 'A' if loop.index == 1 else 'B' }}:</strong>
        <code title="{{ side.variant_id }}">{{ side.variant_id_short }}</code><br>
        {% if side.ordering %}Ordering: {{ side.ordering | join(' → ') }}<br>{% endif %}
        Score: {{ '%.3f' % side.score }} ·
        Verdict:
        {% if side.verdict %}<span class="wc-verdict-pass">PASS</span>{% else %}<span class="wc-verdict-fail">FAIL</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="wc-trace">
        {% if side.node_outputs %}
        {% for n in side.node_outputs %}
        <p><span class="nid">{{ n.node_id }}</span> <span class="role">[{{ n.role }}]</span>: {{ n.response_text }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
        <p style="color:#888;font-size:.78rem;">(no per-node trace available for this cell)</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if side.rationale %}<div class="wc-rationale">Judge: {{ side.rationale }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
<!-- WORSTCASE-SECTION-END -->

<h2>Per-eval variance across orderings</h2>
<figure>
  {{ voo_svg | safe }}
  <figcaption>§9 metric #1 — per-eval np.var across the variant axis (ddof=0). Higher = topology is more order-sensitive on that eval.</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2>Score matrix (variant × eval)</h2>
<figure>
  {{ heatmap_svg | safe }}
  <figcaption>Continuous judge scores. Missing/failed cells render as gray.</figcaption>
</figure>

{% if eval_ids %}
<h2>Eval IDs ({{ eval_ids|length + eval_ids_truncated }})</h2>
<ul class="evals">
{% for e in eval_ids %}<li>{{ e }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% if eval_ids_truncated %}<p style="font-size:.85rem;color:#888;">… and {{ eval_ids_truncated }} more (see manifest.json for the full list).</p>{% endif %}
{% endif %}

<footer>
  topofuzz {{ topofuzz_version }} · generated {{ generated_iso }}
</footer>
</body>
</html>
